config ZMK_RGB_EFFECT_EXAMPLE
    bool "Example custom RGB matrix effect (fx_example)"
    default y
    depends on KEYPAW_RGB_MATRIX
    depends on KEYPAW_BEHAVIOR_RGB_MATRIX
    depends on DT_HAS_KEYPAW_RGB_MATRIX_EXAMPLE_ENABLED
    help
      A worked example of adding a brand-new RGB matrix effect from a *separate*
      module, with no edits to zmk-rgb-matrix. Provides the
      keypaw,rgb-matrix-example compatible and an fx_example child node of &kprgb.
